@* 2026-10-17: moved onto FeatureDemoLayout (one-example-plus-code push, tracker section 6); the two grids became two examples with
   generated code tabs. Changes to the live page (SC-018): the Edit and Del buttons had no handlers, so the Actions column now holds one
   working Remove button (ButtonControl) and a row count below the grid; "auto-sizing" left the intro because nothing configures it.
   Height="100%" became the fixed heights the old cards gave the grids (420px, 300px).
   2026-10-18: vocabulary written from GridColumn.cs (IsFrozen, FrozenPosition, HeaderBand, AllowEditing, the sticky style builders and
   the runtime lock override), GridControl.ColumnFeatures.cs (ColumnHeaderBands, AutoGenerateColumns, the attribute mapping in
   CreateAutoGeneratedColumn and the offset sums in UpdateFrozenColumnOffsets), GridColumnHeaderBand.cs and EditSettings.cs; rows checked
   with scratchpad/vocabcheck.py. The .frozen wrapper exists for the page CSS: pinned body cells use background-color:inherit and the
